{"id":"c289f1c721012496","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md","title":"标准算术结构及其可编码扩张中的真理不可定义","display":"thm-Tarski-undefinability — 标准算术结构及其可编码扩张中的真理不可定义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","aliases":["91-thm-Tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-Tarski-undefinability — 标准算术结构及其可编码扩张中的真理不可定义","depends_on":["[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[91-df-truth-definability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-Tarski-undefinability — 标准算术结构及其可编码扩张中的真理不可定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"850f86d5448feae4\" href=\"?note=850f86d5448feae4\" title=\"91-df-truth-definability\">91-df-truth-definability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=(\\mathbb N,I)\">\\(\\mathfrak M=(\\mathbb N,I)\\)</span> 的算术约化是标准 ℕ；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是可有效编码的算术扩张语言，公式和句子代码有算术可表示的句法谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\tau,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathfrak M\\models\\tau(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\tau,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathfrak M\\models\\tau(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 为至多以 x 自由的候选定义公式；对角引理在该有效语言中适用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 τ 定义全部真理，对 θ(x)=¬τ(x) 对角化得 λ。对角证明只使用真实算术编码等式，故在任意标准算术扩张中仍有 λ↔¬τ(⌜λ⌝)。真理定义又给 λ↔τ(⌜λ⌝)，经典满足矛盾。\n甚至只要求所有标准句上的双条件也不可能；若有这种候选，合取可表示的句子域守卫即可变成全代码域定义。基础语言情形取 M=ℕ、L=L_0 即得通常 Tarski 定理；有限分层标准扩张也适用。\n语义不可定义性不等于某个一致理论内部可证全部双条件。固定复杂度片段的部分真理不受本全域否定结论排除。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 3；Theorem 7.4 的对角论证；可编码标准扩张版本为同一证明的明确推广。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-definability","status":"resolved","id":"850f86d5448feae4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-definability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=(\\mathbb N,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\tau,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathfrak M\\models\\tau(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)).","display":true}],"bytes":1988,"backlinks":[{"id":"54f6107246f40c19","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f343038d47627223","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b23223b4dd97161","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6a4ad5688aac17fe","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9c2daf67c9f2e7b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-cons